        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Jordan dui kanpat puinung kiu,",
            "Gaichuimei kaidai khou tei;",
            "Thuakloumei nun #-5 thuan bammei,",
            "Kaniu lu tei ai chuni.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He poubaumei jei pan #-5 hei ram gaitei,",
            "Kasiam lou the aniu kaguaina khang;",
            "Anuan kaguaina hei kuaklou ngam kanthe,",
            "Tithan lou ngam the kajei hang pan #-5.",
            "",
            "2. Poubaumei bampui ram gaimei,",
            "Ai #-5 nkhuan liak lak khe;",
            "Ringmei thingbang lim gaimei khou,",
            "Bui nung #-5 jang suni cho?",
            "",
            "3. Tingkauh Jerusalem than gai,",
            "Karam gai sangam mak ge;",
            "Khou tei Jisu #-5 khuan bamme,",
            "Namthan gaimei khou gut khang.",
            "",
            "4. Kanloumei pu dang tang pukhou,",
            "Lung rianramei nai lak khe;",
            "Pap puat nritmei phung mei guai,",
            "Hei khou tei lou kei ni the."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
